#. copy/eyebrow
#: src/js/clinic.js:39
msgctxt "tree:copy#/eyebrow"
msgid "EIENTEI UNIVERSITY HOSPITAL / CAMPUS CARE NETWORK"
msgstr "EIENTEI UNIVERSITY HOSPITAL / 学内医療網"

#. copy/title
#: src/js/clinic.js:39
msgctxt "tree:copy#/title"
msgid "First say what is wrong. The route and medicine may argue later."
msgstr "まず、どこに不調があるかを言葉にする。道と薬で揉めるのは、その後だ。"

#. copy/lead
#: src/js/clinic.js:39
msgctxt "tree:copy#/lead"
msgid ""
"The main infirmary handles everyday injuries; Eientei takes cross-species, "
"lunar, boundary, and magical-material cases. Triage, consultations, "
"prescriptions, dispensing, and recovery stay on this device."
msgstr "本部保健室は日常的なけがを、永遠亭は種族をまたぐ症例や、月相・境界・魔法素材への曝露を担当する。トリアージ、診察、処方、調剤、回復の記録は、この端末にのみ保存される。"

